# 换行与二进制类型约定
# Windows 项目：源码/脚本按 CRLF 检出，图片与压缩包一律视为二进制，避免 git 改动字节。

* text=auto

*.cs      text diff=csharp
*.xaml    text
*.csproj  text
*.props   text
*.slnx    text
*.config  text
*.md      text
*.ps1     text

*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.ico     binary
*.zip     binary
*.nupkg   binary
*.dll     binary
*.exe     binary
*.pdb     binary

# 样本是刻意构造的二进制坑题，绝不能被换行转换或 diff 折行
samples/** binary
